OL,3,AAt least one dead and multiple injured
OL,4,Ain Philippines school shooting
OL,5,
OL,6,FA shooting at a high school in southern
OL,7,FPhilippines has left at least one
OL,8,Fperson dead and several injured.
OL,10,FThe incident happened on Friday
OL,11,Fafternoon at Banga National High School
OL,12,Fin South Cotabato, in Mindanao
OL,13,Fprovince.
OL,15,FLocal media and officials have
OL,16,Freporting conflicting casualty figures.
OL,17,FThe identities of the shooter and the
OL,18,Fvictims have not been confirmed.
OL,20,FThe Department of Education said in a
OL,21,Fstatement that it was "deeply concerned
OL,22,Fby the reported shooting incident".
